## 2026 FX Spot+ on CME Globex Trading Schedule

**Normal Hours of Operation:**

*   FX Spot+ Sunday 5:00 p.m. - Friday - 4:00 p.m. CT with a 60-minute break each day beginning at 4:00 p.m. CT
*   FX Spot+ NZD Sunday 5:00 p.m. - Friday - 4:00 p.m. CT with a trade date roll at 7am NZT and a 60-minute break each day beginning at 4:00 p.m. CT

