| BFIX | 17:00 GMT | Fixings every half-hour from Sunday at 17:30 ET through Friday at 17:00 ET | 0:05:30 | 1. Fixings NOT between 16:30 ET and 18:30 ET: Reopen all each day at 17:00 ET 2. Fixings between 16:30 ET and 18:00 ET: Reopen all each day at 19:00 ET 3. 18:30 ET Fixing: Reopen at 19:30 ET |
| HSRA | 17:00 GMT | One fixing daily Mon-Fri 10:00 Sydney | 0:03:00 | Reopen each day at 13:00 Sydney |
| TKFE | 17:00 GMT | Fixings hourly Mon-Friday from 9:00 Tokyo to 17:00 Tokyo | 0:03:00 | Reopen each day at 17:00 ET |
| TMA | 17:00 GMT | One fixing daily Mon-Fri 11:30 HKT | 0:45:30 | Reopen each day at 17:00 ET |
| WM London | 17:00 GMT | Fixings hourly from Sunday at 17:00 EST/18:00 EDT through Friday 17:00 ET | 0:03:00 | 1. Fixings except 17:00 ET and 18:00 ET: Reopen all each day at 17:00 ET. 2. 17:00 ET and 18:00 ET fixings: Reopen each day at 19:00 ET. |
| WMR Tokyo | 17:00 GMT | One Fixing Daily Mon-Fri 9:55 Tokyo | 0:03:00 | Reopen each day at 17:00 ET |

