## 2026 CME Globex Freeze Calendar

*   During a Freeze weekend, there is no customer testing allowed.
*   New iLink session IDs can be built and deleted on the Friday before the freeze weekend.
*   Details regarding Saturday testing are available in section**7 Saturday Testing**of the[iLink Session ID Policy and Operational Guidelines](https://www.cmegroup.com/globex/files/iLinkSessionIDPolicy.pdf).
*   No customer testing is available on Reliability Engineering and Operations (REO) weekends.
*   No customer testing is available on Web Data Reliability Engineering and Operations (WDREO) weekends.

